It doesn't, but if you set your alarm clock to wake you up in an hour,
and someone kills you in your sleep, you have an analogy. If you're
unconscious, it's only reasonable to assume that you will remain so until
you are woken up.
Next time, try kipping near a teleport trap or a trapdoor, or just keep
pressing the '.' key until you're fit to continue. If you want to play
without applying any skill to the game, use the discovery mode.
The team have it right this time.

